<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height:1.5; color:#222; max-width:680px;">
  <p>Dear <strong><%= @selection.supplier_name %></strong> Sales Team,</p>

  <p>We are <strong>AtoZ2010 Inc.</strong> (Procurement Department), reaching out regarding the following items.
     We would like to receive your best quotation including unit price, lead time, MOQ, and shipping terms.</p>

  <h3 style="border-bottom:1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom:4px;">Items Requested</h3>
  <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:13px;">
    <thead style="background:#f5f5f5;">
      <tr>
        <th style="text-align:left;">#</th>
        <th style="text-align:left;">Item</th>
        <th style="text-align:left;">Spec</th>
        <th style="text-align:right;">Qty</th>
        <th style="text-align:left;">Unit</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <% @items.each_with_index do |item, i| %>
        <tr>
          <td><%= i + 1 %></td>
          <td><strong><%= item[:name].presence || item["name"] %></strong>
            <% model = item[:model] || item["model"] %>
            <% if model.present? %><br><small><%= model %></small><% end %>
          </td>
          <td><%= item[:spec].presence || item["spec"] %></td>
          <td style="text-align:right;"><%= item[:quantity].presence || item["quantity"] || "—" %></td>
          <td><%= item[:unit].presence || item["unit"] %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="border-bottom:1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom:4px; margin-top:24px;">Requirements</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Quotation in writing</strong> with unit price (USD or local currency), lead time, MOQ.</li>
    <li><strong>Delivery</strong>: <%= @order.try(:client)&.country.presence || "South Korea / UAE — please advise on Incoterms" %></li>
    <li><strong>Certifications</strong>: please indicate KS / CE / API / ATEX / ISO compliance where applicable.</li>
    <li><strong>Validity</strong>: please indicate quote validity period.</li>
  </ul>

  <% if @order.reference_no.present? %>
    <p><strong>Our RFQ Reference</strong>: <%= @order.reference_no %></p>
  <% end %>

  <p>Please reply to <strong><%= @from_user&.email %></strong> at your earliest convenience.</p>

  <p style="margin-top:24px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid #eee; color:#666; font-size:12px;">
    Best regards,<br>
    <strong><%= @from_user&.display_name %></strong> · AtoZ2010 Inc. — Procurement<br>
    Email: <%= @from_user&.email %>
  </p>

  <p style="color:#aaa; font-size:11px; margin-top:16px;">
    This message was generated by CPOFlow LAB / RFQ Auto. Original attachments included.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
